  .claude\skills\work\WORKFLOW.md:11:`orchestrator-opus.md`, `executor.md`, `mechanical.md`, `distiller.md`. The 
coordinator has no
  .claude\skills\work\WORKFLOW.md:12:definition file of its own — it is the founder's own session, so its contract is 
the skill.
